---
// "Need help now?" pointer to WV 211. Facts: content/resources/wv-211.yaml.
const { heading = true } = Astro.props;
---
<section class="note" aria-labelledby={heading ? 'help-now-h' : undefined}>
  {heading && <h2 id="help-now-h">Need help now?</h2>}
  <p>If you need food, a place to stay, or help with a bill, call <a href="tel:211">211</a>. It is free and open 24 hours a day, every day. You can also text your ZIP code to 898-211 or chat at <a href="https://www.wv211.org">wv211.org</a>. Tell them what you need and they will point you to local help.</p>
  <p class="meta">Run by West Virginia 211. Source: <a href="https://bfa.wv.gov/page/west-virginia-211">bfa.wv.gov</a>. Checked by hand on October 28, 2026.</p>
</section>
